{"game": "helldivers-2", "language": "schinese", "appid": 553850, "month": "2025-09", "window": 3, "start_date": 1757980800, "end_date": 1758671999, "month_true_total": 1668, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 22:29:06 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "205071159", "author": {"steamid": "76561199023196253", "personaname": "柒夏", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199023196253/", "num_games_owned": 32, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 56464, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 2886, "playtime_at_review": 56016, "last_played": 1787982703, "avatar": "85e2e1f7a9fd4d95ab0c255c7947601cb494d13e"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "好玩但是怪太弱了没挑战性:)", "timestamp_created": 1758666556, "timestamp_updated": 1787862889, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "205054431", "author": {"steamid": "76561199200502360", "personaname": "白毛黑皮体育生", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199200502360/", "num_games_owned": 20, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 27449, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 176, "playtime_at_review": 5133, "last_played": 1787926891, "avatar": "de23101bdd468001f7f96590447f5d5407e78b86"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "游戏很好玩，开荒很难受，如果不是拿到野狼的话，我可能三十个小时都玩不下去，这游戏前期一点体验感都没有，朋友推荐我买爆破，但是里面武器我都不会玩，一局能死十几次，拿到野狼之后我才感觉到这游戏的爽感，好玩爱玩，就是bug多，野排人树脂参差不齐，但游戏还是好游戏，还有，tmd瓯绍恩把掠食放进来是真的ex，比耄耋还ex，现在玩瓯绍恩是真的会享受", "timestamp_created": 1758658650, "timestamp_updated": 1758658650, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.513618707656860352", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 16, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "205043405", "author": {"steamid": "76561198362161681", "personaname": "逸卿", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198362161681/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 6658, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 34, "playtime_at_review": 2815, "last_played": 1787589789, "avatar": "fd5d0832857803c361cb5f3fbc44b4f80e86b39d"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "很好玩，大家一起捍卫超级地球，纯PVE的方法让大家都没什么压力，并且全球同服还不需要加速器之类的，能和全球的玩家交流很有趣。尤其是每个玩家都很可爱，中二，增加了不少代入感。推荐给了很多朋友，但是他们似乎没什么兴趣。缺点的话，优化问题，卡顿和延迟偶尔会有挺影响游戏体验的，另外就是策划不要再背刺玩家了，我知道你们会整活，希望下次这个游戏不需要拯救而是一直蒸蒸日上。", "timestamp_created": 1758648254, "timestamp_updated": 1758648254, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "205043147", "author": {"steamid": "76561199015485783", "personaname": "城之内悠二", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199015485783/", "num_games_owned": 2500, "num_reviews": 59, "playtime_forever": 1414, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1414, "last_played": 1750607432, "avatar": "63adc75fe6bf11234de35ff1b665f2efa5f34a0b"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "Super Earth!Our home.\nProsperity.\nLiberty.（Hi，dear）\nDemocracy.\nOur way of life. （Ah，hello）\nBut freedom doesnt come freely.（No，sweet liberty，no！！！） \n（INVASION）\nHaha,look familiar? \nThings like this are happenning all over the galaxy right now!U could be NEXT!\nThat is,unless u make the most important decision in your life. Prove to yourself that you have the strength and courage TO BE FREE!\nJoin, The Helldivers!\nBecome part of an elite peacekeeping force.\nSee exotic new life forms and spread managed\nDEMOCRACY throughout the galaxy.\nBecome a Hero.\nBecome a Legend.\nBecome a Helldiver.", "timestamp_created": 1758648010, "timestamp_updated": 1758648010, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "205042811", "author": {"steamid": "76561198140501171", "personaname": "巨兽级强袭虫", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/605317032/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 19132, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 262, "playtime_at_review": 16360, "last_played": 1787841894, "avatar": "4cfdd262023924966944e2709a75e91d3c749fc5"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "我操你妈的逼小逼崽子箭头做的B游戏，每次更新加强怪比加强玩家多得多，打一把N10你不骂箭头的你是这个", "timestamp_created": 1758647715, "timestamp_updated": 1777480678, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}]}